  "cleanerHelp": "The manager uses the local ADB connection configured in TV control settings. It never uninstalls apps or clears their data. The snapshot and recovery journal are separate from ordinary backups. Recovery restores previous states only for packages changed by this manager. Automatic recovery is blocked after a firmware change.\n\nVerified lists match exact firmware. Observed and external lists do not establish safety. Protected components, HOME and active services cannot be disabled. Packages are previewed before applying; missing and already disabled packages are skipped.\n\nThe project catalog is bundled from Git. GitHub refresh requires a public catalog. External examples load only on request and never execute scripts. Export creates JSON containing disabled packages and firmware identity; add it manually to catalog/examples after review. Nothing is uploaded automatically.\n\nApp descriptions and risk remain visible. Unconfirmed purposes are marked explicitly and never included in verified lists.",
